Forwarding the lessons learned from the Rotterdam go-live that Ruud Jansen sh=
ared with me. Please read it before the workshop on 5 Nov.

The points that matter most for Venlo: 38 of about 4,100 bins had stock diffe=
rences after migration, the one-day handheld training was too short, and the =
cut-over took 31 hours instead of the 24 planned. I want to use these in the =
Venlo plan.

Regards,
